# Job
hpc:Job a owl:Class .
hpc:jobID rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
    rdfs:domain hpc:Job ;
    rdfs:range xsd:integer .
hpc:partition rdf:type owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:domain hpc:Job .
hpc:state rdf:type owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:domain hpc:Job .
hpc:time rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
    rdfs:domain hpc:Job ;
    rdfs:range xsd:duration .
hpc:user rdf:type owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:domain hpc:Job .
hpc:nodes rdf:type owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:domain hpc:Job .
hpc:nodeList rdf:type owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:domain hpc:Job .

# Partition
hpc:Partition a owl:Class .
hpc:partitionName rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
    rdfs:domain hpc:Partition .
hpc:nodes rdf:type owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:domain hpc:Partition .
hpc:default rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
    rdfs:domain hpc:Partition .
hpc:overSubscribe rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
    rdfs:domain hpc:Partition .
hpc:priorityTier rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
    rdfs:domain hpc:Partition .
hpc:preemptMode rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
    rdfs:domain hpc:Partition .

# Node
hpc:Node a owl:Class .
```

This ontology fragment defines classes for Job, Partition, and Node, as well as properties for each class. The properties include jobID, partition, state, time, user, nodes, nodeList, partitionName, nodes, default, overSubscribe, priorityTier, and preemptMode. The properties are defined as datatype or object properties, and their domains and ranges are specified.
